    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Void Wave Drift</i>, you pilot customizable <strong>Ionblades</strong>\u2014sleek anti-gravity racers forged for high-velocity combat across fractured tracks and alien skylines. Tear through the void using tactical powerups, unleash devastating attacks, and carve new paths by <strong>blasting shortcuts through destructible track segments.<br><br>Customize Your Ionblade:</strong> Change the look of your ship in the garage. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift the Void:</strong> Master gravity-defying tracks across exotic worlds, orbital cities, and unstable rift zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerups With Purpose:</strong> Deploy offensive and defensive gear mid-race\u2014disrupt rivals or clear the path ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible Shortcuts:</strong> Unleash firepower to shatter parts of the track and unlock new shortcuts to win the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Conquer classic circuits, elimination sprints, and time and speed trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sleek &amp; Stylish:</strong> Pulse with a synth-fueled soundtrack and a razor-sharp visual identity inspired by sci-fi legends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision. Destruction. Speed.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Void Wave Drift</i>, you pilot customizable <strong>Ionblades</strong>\u2014sleek anti-gravity racers forged for high-velocity combat across fractured tracks and alien skylines. Tear through the void using tactical powerups, unleash devastating attacks, and carve new paths by <strong>blasting shortcuts through destructible track segments.<br><br>Customize Your Ionblade:</strong> Change the look of your ship in the garage. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drift the Void:</strong> Master gravity-defying tracks across exotic worlds, orbital cities, and unstable rift zones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerups With Purpose:</strong> Deploy offensive and defensive gear mid-race\u2014disrupt rivals or clear the path ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Destructible Shortcuts:</strong> Unleash firepower to shatter parts of the track and unlock new shortcuts to win the race.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes:</strong> Conquer classic circuits, elimination sprints, and time and speed trials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sleek &amp; Stylish:</strong> Pulse with a synth-fueled soundtrack and a razor-sharp visual identity inspired by sci-fi legends.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision. Destruction. Speed.</strong></p>",
